sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Web
    boundary API
    control Scheduler
    entity Record
    queue Jobs
    collections Workers
    database Store
    User->>Web: open page
    Web->>API: POST /run
    API->>Scheduler: enqueue
    Scheduler->>Jobs: push job
    Jobs->>Workers: dispatch
    Workers->>Record: load
    Record->>Store: read
    Store-->>Record: row
    Record-->>Workers: entity
    Workers-->>Scheduler: done
    Scheduler-->>API: ok
    API-->>Web: 200
    Web-->>User: rendered
